      "content": "hey, quick question. i've been having this really annoying gnawing pain in my upper stomach lately, kinda feels like bad indigestion that won't go away. im taking omeprazole everyday for it but its not helping much. anyway, i just got a really bad toothache too... is it okay if i take some advil for the pain? i dont want to mess up my stomach more but the tooth is killing me.",
