      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should see a doctor but i'm just so busy and honestly it's just stomach stuff, nothing serious. i've been on the omeprazole for a while so it's protecting my stomach lining, right? wouldn't the omeprazole basically cancel out the irritation from the advil? i really just need to know if i can take a couple of ibuprofen so i can sleep tonight.",
